{"id":"wb-4-110","name":"托林寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"托林寺","text":"托林寺（藏语：མཐོ་ལྡིང་དགོན་པ，威利转写：mtho lding dgon pa）位于中国西藏自治区阿里地区札达县，是一座藏传佛教格鲁派寺院，也是阿里地区历史上第一座佛教寺庙，藏传佛教后弘期上路弘法的发源地。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%89%98%E6%9E%97%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94276945,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94276945","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/dad23335b79b2dc2349b5d68.jpg","title":"Tholing_monastery_(Tibet)_Dieter_Schuh.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tholing_monastery_(Tibet)_Dieter_Schuh.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/50/Tholing_monastery_%28Tibet%29_Dieter_Schuh.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Dieter Schuh","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"Tholing Monastery in Westtibet in the evening light","width":320,"height":213}}